---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Hollywood Time"
  description="Hollywood Time Privacy Policy detailing data collection practices, cookies, analytics, and consumer data rights under GDPR and CCPA."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8">
    <nav class="text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-black">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-900 font-bold">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="border-b-2 border-zinc-950 pb-6 mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-red-600 block mb-2">Legal Compliance</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-headline tracking-tight uppercase text-zinc-950">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-mono text-zinc-500 mt-2">
        Last Updated: September 22, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-zinc-800 font-sans leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>Hollywood Time</strong> ("we", "our", or "us"), we value your trust and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your information when you visit <code>hollywoodtime.com</code> (the "Site").
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We may collect information in several ways:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Information You Voluntarily Provide:</strong> If you subscribe to our editorial newsletter, submit a news tip, or contact our newsroom, we may collect your name, email address, and message content.</li>
          <li><strong>Automated Usage Data:</strong> When you navigate our Site, our servers automatically log standard information including your IP address, browser type, device specifications, operating system, pages viewed, and referral URLs.</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies & Tracking Technologies:</strong> We use cookies to enhance navigation efficiency, remember reader preferences, and analyze traffic patterns.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use collected data solely to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Deliver, maintain, and optimize the performance of the Hollywood Time website.</li>
          <li>Distribute requested editorial bulletins, newsletters, or press alerts.</li>
          <li>Monitor network performance, detect technical bugs, and protect against security threats.</li>
          <li>Analyze aggregated traffic patterns to understand which entertainment topics interest our audience.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">4. Third-Party Services & Google Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          We may partner with third-party advertising vendors (such as Google AdSense) and analytics providers (such as Google Analytics). These third parties may use cookies and web beacons to serve advertisements based on prior visits to our Site or other websites on the Internet.
        </p>
        <p>
          Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ads Settings (<a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" class="text-red-600 underline">google.com/settings/ads</a>).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-black text-zinc-950">5. Your Privacy Rights (GDPR & CCPA)</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on your location, you hold specific statutory rights regarding your personal information, including the right to access, rectify, or request deletion of data held about you. California residents have the right under CCPA to request disclosure of categories of personal information collected.
        </p>
        <p>
          To exercise any privacy rights, please contact our Data Protection Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@hollywoodtime.com" class="text-red-600 underline">privacy@hollywoodtime.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
